@startuml

' ===== 字体与样式设置（确保论文打印清晰） =====
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontName SimHei
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 25
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam noteBorderColor #666666

' ===== 参与者定义 =====
actor "管理员" as Admin
participant "古树名木\n数据上传页" as UploadPage
participant "TreeController" as Controller
participant "TreeMapper" as TreeMapper
participant "ImageInfoMapper" as ImageMapper
participant "DHLAM模型\nHashModelRetrieveService" as DHLAM
participant "MySQL数据库" as DB
participant "文件系统" as FS

' ===== 前置条件说明 =====
note over Admin, UploadPage
  <b>前置条件：</b>管理员已完成登录并携带有效Token，
  具备古树名木数据录入权限（perRoleId=1）
end note

' ===== 流程1：表单信息录入 =====
autonumber 1
Admin -> UploadPage: 填写古树基础信息
note right
  古树名称、树种、科、属、保护级别、
  纬度、经度、树龄、树高、备注描述
end note
activate UploadPage

' ===== 流程2：图像上传 =====
autonumber 2
Admin -> UploadPage: 拖拽/点击上传古树图像
UploadPage -> Controller: POST /tree/upload (MultipartFile)
activate Controller

Controller -> FS: 保存图像至 imageRoot 目录
activate FS
FS --> Controller: 返回存储路径
note right
  原始文件名 → UUID 重命名
  后缀保留（.jpg / .png）
end note
deactivate FS

Controller --> UploadPage: 返回 FileUploadResp
note right
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "uuid-filename.jpg"
  }
end note
deactivate Controller

UploadPage --> Admin: 前端预览已上传图像

' ===== 流程3：数据提交保存 =====
autonumber 3
Admin -> UploadPage: 点击"提交数据"按钮
UploadPage -> Controller: POST /tree/save (TreeSaveReq)
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: 参数校验（名称、物种非空）

' ===== treeCode 生成（具体逻辑，非自动生成） =====
autonumber 4
Controller -> TreeMapper: selectAll()
activate TreeMapper
TreeMapper -> DB: SELECT * FROM tree WHERE is_delete = 0
activate DB
DB --> TreeMapper: 返回 List<Tree>
deactivate DB
TreeMapper --> Controller: 返回全部记录
deactivate TreeMapper

Controller -> Controller: 遍历解析 treeCode 整数值，取最大值 max
Controller -> Controller: max + 1，格式化为 3 位字符串（String.format("%03d", max + 1)）
note right
  例如：现有最大编号 008 → 生成 009
end note

' ===== tree 表插入 =====
autonumber 5
Controller -> TreeMapper: insert(Tree)
activate TreeMapper
TreeMapper -> DB: INSERT INTO tree (tree_code, name, species, family, genus, protection_level, age, height, latitude, longitude, desc, ...)
activate DB
DB --> TreeMapper: 返回自增主键 id
deactivate DB
TreeMapper --> Controller: 返回影响行数
deactivate TreeMapper

' ===== 流程4：DHLAM 模型生成哈希码并保存图像记录 =====
autonumber 6
Controller -> Controller: 遍历 imageList
loop 每张上传图像
  Controller -> DHLAM: generate(imagePath, latitude, longitude)
  activate DHLAM

  DHLAM -> DHLAM: ImageEncoder：读取图像文件 → CRC32/像素特征提取 → 64位图像特征
  note right
    模拟 ResNet-50 视觉特征提取流程
  end note

  DHLAM -> DHLAM: LocationEncoder：lat/lon → MLP编码 → 64位位置特征
  note right
    论文 3.2.2 节：MLP(2→128→128→256)
  end note

  DHLAM -> DHLAM: Fusion：图像特征与位置特征拼接融合

  DHLAM -> DHLAM: HashLayer：FC → Tanh → Sign → 128位二进制哈希码
  note right
    训练阶段：Tanh 输出连续值（梯度可回传）
    推理阶段：Sign 量化为离散二进制
  end note

  DHLAM --> Controller: 返回 HashResult(hashCode, hashBits)
  deactivate DHLAM

  Controller -> ImageMapper: insert(Image)
  activate ImageMapper
  ImageMapper -> DB: INSERT INTO image (tree_id, image_path, hash_code, hash_bits, ...)
  activate DB
  DB --> ImageMapper: 返回自增主键
  deactivate DB
  ImageMapper --> Controller: 返回影响行数
  deactivate ImageMapper
end

Controller --> UploadPage: 返回 CommonResp<Tree>
note right
  {
    "success": true,
    "content": {
      "treeCode": "009",
      "name": "...",
      "species": "..."
    }
  }
end note
deactivate Controller

UploadPage --> Admin: 提示"数据上传成功，古树编号：009"
deactivate UploadPage

' ===== 底部说明 =====
note over Controller, TreeMapper
  <b>treeCode 生成策略：</b>查询 tree 表全部记录，遍历解析 treeCode 整数值取最大值，
  加 1 后格式化为 3 位字符串（001, 002, ..., 009），确保编号唯一且有序。
end note

note over Controller, FS
  <b>图像存储：</b>保存在项目根目录下 algorithm/data_samples/bfath_demo/，
  文件名采用 UUID 避免冲突，原始后缀保留。
end note

note over DHLAM, Controller
  <b>DHLAM 哈希编码：</b>数据上传阶段即调用模型生成 128 位哈希码存入数据库，
  避免检索阶段实时计算，提升查询响应速度（论文表 3.8：0.8ms）。
end note

@enduml
